[I] Finite element analysis software

[T] The Sandia Engineering Analysis Code Access System (SEACAS) is a suite of
[T] preprocessing, postprocessing, translation, and utility applications,
[T] supporting finite element analysis software using the Exodus database file
[T] format.

[U] https://github.com/sandialabs/seacas

